              "fill": "#374151",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Error states are not always actionable, so users pause or retry the wrong thing.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "53e1o",
              "name": "fric3",
              "fill": "#374151",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Returning users lose momentum when they cannot quickly resume where they left off.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "SZdJl",
          "name": "Agent 2 - What To Change",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "cornerRadius": 12,
          "stroke": "#E5E7EB",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "strokeAlignment": "inner",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "padding": [
            16,
            16,
            18,
            16
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rRvIa",
              "name": "title",
              "fill": "#111827",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "What To Change",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Dvp3r",
              "name": "subtitle",
              "fill": "#4B5563",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Top 5 UX priorities for Divine Link (executive summary)",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qsP6D",
              "name": "item1",
              "fill": "#1F2937",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Simplify first-time setup. Why it matters: Fewer steps reduce drop-off and help users reach value in their first session.",
              "lineHeight": 1.35,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "QXi0E",
              "name": "item2",
              "fill": "#1F2937",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Make primary actions obvious on every screen. Why it matters: Clear next steps improve task completion and lower decision fatigue.",
              "lineHeight": 1.35,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lGp9d",
              "name": "item3",
              "fill": "#1F2937",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Improve content hierarchy and spacing. Why it matters: Better scanability helps leaders and teams find key information quickly.",
              "lineHeight": 1.35,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mUk4U",
              "name": "item4",
              "fill": "#1F2937",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Standardize feedback states (loading, success, error). Why it matters: Predictable responses build trust and reduce support escalations.",
              "lineHeight": 1.35,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NLMEV",
              "name": "item5",
              "fill": "#1F2937",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Strengthen accessibility basics (contrast, labels, focus). Why it matters: Inclusive UX broadens reach and reduces compliance risk.",
              "lineHeight": 1.35,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
